    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:0",
      "text": "The iOS release where are we?"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:1",
      "text": "4.2 is in just like two crash reports from the beta testers both on older iPads."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:2",
      "text": "Is that a blocker?"
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:3",
      "text": "Not for phones. I would ship phones now and fix the iPad crash in 4.2.1."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:4",
      "text": "Okay, submit to App Store review on Wednesday then."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:5",
      "text": "Wednesday morning, it review usually takes a day, so we would go live Thursday or Friday."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:6",
      "text": "Hold the release until Monday. I don't want a launch going out on Friday with nobody on the call."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:7",
      "text": "Fair. Manual release Monday at 10 AM."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:8",
      "text": "And I I will write the release notes and send them to you by Tuesday."
    },
    {
      "id": "rec-ios-release:seg:9",
      "text": "Great. Keep them under the four lines the store cuts of the rest."
    }
